Searxly bundles the SearXNG metasearch engine as a self-contained Python runtime
(shipped inside the macOS app at Contents/Resources/searxng-runtime) and runs it
as a separate local process on 127.0.0.1. Searxly also distributes a modified
SearXNG theme and configuration overlay in the LocalSearxng/ directory of this
repository.

  Component : SearXNG metasearch engine
  Copyright : © SearXNG contributors (see the project's AUTHORS)
  License   : AGPL-3.0-or-later
  Upstream  : https://github.com/searxng/searxng
  Version   : 2026.6.23+e371371 (as bundled in this release)

Searxly's modifications to SearXNG (the AGPL-covered parts):
  - LocalSearxng/custom/  — theme: Jinja template overrides + searxly.css
  - LocalSearxng/searxng/ — settings.yml.example and limiter.toml overlays
  - Runtime configuration patching performed by the app at setup time
    (see Searxly/Services/LocalSearxngManager+ConfigPatching.swift)

